WEBVTT

00:00:24.490 --> 00:00:28.380
I hear the ultimate stage calling to me...

00:02:12.400 --> 00:02:15.460
This voice! This melody!

00:02:15.460 --> 00:02:18.150
They'll be perfect for the final movement!

00:02:18.150 --> 00:02:22.200
I need more! Play on, Aquarion!

00:02:22.530 --> 00:02:26.910
Where is that energy coming from, Shrade?!

00:02:26.910 --> 00:02:31.670
It's beautiful! Elegant and delicate, but strong and passionate!

00:02:32.300 --> 00:02:34.960
I can feel its rhythm in my heart!

00:02:34.960 --> 00:02:37.100
I've never felt this way before!

00:02:37.800 --> 00:02:43.050
Shrade isn't wearing an Element suit. His body is effectively exposed.

00:02:43.480 --> 00:02:45.590
That means he can feel his surroundings keenly.

00:02:45.590 --> 00:02:49.560
But it also means his body is taking more damage.

00:02:49.560 --> 00:02:52.560
He's seriously risking his life.

00:02:53.130 --> 00:02:54.690
Shrade...

00:02:55.620 --> 00:02:59.360
Let my heart play its greatest <i>cadenza</i>!

00:03:04.170 --> 00:03:07.250
What I saw was real.

00:03:07.870 --> 00:03:09.910
You're me.

00:03:11.100 --> 00:03:14.920
No wonder I could never smell you.

00:03:16.040 --> 00:03:17.900
You smell the same as I do.

00:03:19.310 --> 00:03:22.320
This picture shows me.

00:03:23.090 --> 00:03:24.560
And you.

00:03:25.800 --> 00:03:29.240
We were originally one person.

00:03:30.200 --> 00:03:32.430
Until that day...

00:03:34.360 --> 00:03:35.610
No!

00:03:35.610 --> 00:03:38.110
No! No!

00:03:38.700 --> 00:03:41.270
Don't leave me!

00:03:59.570 --> 00:04:04.760
Amata just watched as fate slipped away from him that day.

00:04:05.500 --> 00:04:07.160
And that's you.

00:04:11.050 --> 00:04:13.140
You haven't changed one bit.

00:04:13.590 --> 00:04:17.520
You're still a pathetic wimp who can't do a thing when it really counts.

00:04:18.160 --> 00:04:23.020
What about you? You never saved Mom, either!

00:04:23.020 --> 00:04:26.100
What have you been doing on Altair?

00:04:27.380 --> 00:04:32.290
I made it across the dimensions, but I ended up losing Mother.

00:04:33.110 --> 00:04:35.610
And then, Mikage found me.

00:04:36.250 --> 00:04:41.810
Welcome, fragmented one. Dark Amata.

00:04:47.360 --> 00:04:52.610
From this day on, you are now Kagura.

00:04:54.670 --> 00:04:58.810
I had lost my memories, but Mikage raised me.

00:05:01.540 --> 00:05:04.140
I don't care about my mother anymore.

00:05:04.710 --> 00:05:08.950
I have no idea who or where she is. Same with my father.

00:05:08.950 --> 00:05:11.920
There's only one smell I care about.

00:05:12.910 --> 00:05:17.740
My own dear smelly wench, the real Silvie!

00:05:19.910 --> 00:05:25.810
I'm not pathetic! And I won't let you have Mikono!

00:05:30.850 --> 00:05:32.740
See? Pathetic.

00:05:33.270 --> 00:05:35.270
You're not good enough!

00:05:35.270 --> 00:05:38.900
Stop! Why are you fighting?

00:05:38.900 --> 00:05:42.020
Please! Stop fighting!

00:05:43.900 --> 00:05:47.630
The Wings of the Sun are finally awakening.

00:06:23.570 --> 00:06:25.760
What's the matter, Amata?

00:06:25.760 --> 00:06:28.530
You think that you're not pathetic? Prove it!

00:06:35.540 --> 00:06:36.890
The hell?

00:06:45.300 --> 00:06:46.300
Mikono!

00:06:46.300 --> 00:06:47.450
Silvie!

00:06:51.840 --> 00:06:53.100
Mikono!

00:07:03.310 --> 00:07:05.070
Aquarion?

00:07:10.570 --> 00:07:12.320
What's going on?

00:07:12.890 --> 00:07:14.860
Detecting higher-dimensional quanta!

00:07:14.860 --> 00:07:16.950
They're coming from near the old lake!

00:07:31.930 --> 00:07:33.430
What do these mean?

00:07:33.430 --> 00:07:36.180
Aquarion is resonating with that thing.

00:07:36.180 --> 00:07:41.690
This is an ancient melody, echoing to our ears from 12,000 years ago!

00:07:43.120 --> 00:07:44.980
There can be no mistake.

00:07:44.980 --> 00:07:49.780
That is the Legendary Aquarion from the myth!

00:08:00.580 --> 00:08:02.010
At last!

00:08:02.530 --> 00:08:05.580
At last you show yourself, Wings of the Sun!

00:08:15.250 --> 00:08:16.740
Where am I?

00:08:19.110 --> 00:08:20.680
Aquarion?

00:08:20.680 --> 00:08:23.240
It's different...

00:08:23.240 --> 00:08:26.190
Mikono! Mikono!

00:08:26.190 --> 00:08:27.950
Amata!

00:08:27.950 --> 00:08:29.190
Silvie!

00:08:30.860 --> 00:08:33.550
I've been waiting for you, Silvie!

00:08:33.550 --> 00:08:36.220
For 12,000 long years!

00:08:36.220 --> 00:08:38.870
But now I can finally kill you!

00:08:38.870 --> 00:08:41.020
You want to kill Mikono?!

00:08:41.020 --> 00:08:43.620
You bet I want to kill her!

00:08:44.250 --> 00:08:46.910
Bitterly, violently, and coldly!

00:08:46.910 --> 00:08:49.540
I'm going to kill her over and over!

00:08:51.010 --> 00:08:53.180
But first...

00:08:54.260 --> 00:08:56.960
I'm going to crush you, Amata!

00:08:57.510 --> 00:08:59.460
Wait for me, Silvie!

00:08:59.460 --> 00:09:03.620
Once I'm done with him, we can kill each other all night long!

00:09:03.620 --> 00:09:04.520
What?

00:09:04.520 --> 00:09:07.440
I won't let you touch her!

00:09:21.810 --> 00:09:24.740
The higher-dimensional quantum emissions are still rising!

00:09:25.290 --> 00:09:29.040
Guess that settles it. That's the real deal.

00:09:29.040 --> 00:09:31.800
The Legendary Aquarion?

00:09:31.800 --> 00:09:34.470
The stories are coming to life...

00:09:34.470 --> 00:09:38.800
I can't believe we're actually here to see this moment in history...

00:09:40.060 --> 00:09:45.060
It's momentous, all right. So why is that kid messing around over there?

00:09:45.060 --> 00:09:48.060
That is another legend in itself.

00:09:48.620 --> 00:09:51.820
High Commander Fudo! When did you return?

00:09:52.750 --> 00:09:56.820
You needn't concern yourself with this lovers' spat!

00:10:02.620 --> 00:10:03.870
Amata!

00:10:13.760 --> 00:10:15.170
You can't have her!

00:10:15.170 --> 00:10:16.470
Give up, already.

00:10:17.020 --> 00:10:20.630
This was destined 12,000 years ago.

00:10:21.250 --> 00:10:23.680
You and Silvie aren't fated.

00:10:24.440 --> 00:10:28.220
You can't fight fate, no matter how much you struggle.

00:10:28.220 --> 00:10:33.690
Fate even brought us together across the worlds.

00:10:33.690 --> 00:10:37.700
I have the wings to overcome fate!

00:10:40.570 --> 00:10:43.840
Your wings are useless if you can't fly.

00:10:43.840 --> 00:10:46.580
Well, can you? Fly if you can!

00:10:49.370 --> 00:10:53.500
Stop! Don't hurt Amata anymore!

00:10:53.500 --> 00:10:56.340
I hate that smile of yours, Silvie.

00:10:56.340 --> 00:10:58.250
It makes me want to kill you even more.

00:10:58.770 --> 00:11:01.510
Smile more for me.

00:11:01.510 --> 00:11:04.840
More! Smile more!

00:11:19.650 --> 00:11:21.070
Where am I?

00:11:22.850 --> 00:11:26.080
Am I dead?

00:11:27.770 --> 00:11:29.080
Amata!

00:11:29.080 --> 00:11:32.080
I'm so glad you're okay, Zessica!

00:11:32.420 --> 00:11:33.760
Me too, Amata!

00:11:34.330 --> 00:11:38.590
Did you come back because you were worried about me?

00:11:40.520 --> 00:11:43.450
Zessica, I finally understand.

00:11:44.000 --> 00:11:46.600
I finally know what's precious to me.

00:11:46.600 --> 00:11:48.160
Amata...

00:11:50.530 --> 00:11:52.600
So please, wake up.

00:11:55.580 --> 00:11:57.420
You can't die yet.

00:11:58.120 --> 00:11:59.210
Because...

00:12:01.310 --> 00:12:06.120
You haven't fulfilled your promise to me.

00:12:09.500 --> 00:12:12.260
No!

00:12:18.490 --> 00:12:20.910
<i>You can't die yet.</i>

00:12:20.910 --> 00:12:25.940
<i>Because you haven't fulfilled your promise to me.</i>

00:12:29.670 --> 00:12:31.070
What promise?

00:12:35.160 --> 00:12:37.480
Please, stop!

00:12:37.480 --> 00:12:40.990
I don't want to see you two fight anymore!

00:12:40.990 --> 00:12:43.170
I can't do that, Mikono!

00:12:43.170 --> 00:12:45.360
I'm going to settle this right now!

00:12:45.360 --> 00:12:46.670
Huh?

00:12:46.670 --> 00:12:49.060
Settle what?

00:12:49.140 --> 00:12:53.530
You want Mikono because you think you're destined?

00:12:53.530 --> 00:12:56.380
Exactly. How many times do I have to say it?

00:12:56.380 --> 00:12:59.380
Well, not me!

00:12:59.380 --> 00:13:02.380
I don't care if Mikono is the reincarnation of Silvie!

00:13:02.830 --> 00:13:06.390
I don't care about whatever was fated 12,000 years ago!

00:13:06.390 --> 00:13:10.630
I love Mikono as she is right now!

00:13:10.630 --> 00:13:10.640
Amata!
I love Mikono as she is right now!

00:13:10.640 --> 00:13:12.210
Amata!

00:13:12.640 --> 00:13:14.140
Amata...

00:13:14.140 --> 00:13:21.230
Mikono as she is right here, right now, this instant!

00:13:21.230 --> 00:13:23.930
Then let's see which one's stronger:

00:13:23.930 --> 00:13:29.160
my destiny, or your burning emotions!

00:13:39.870 --> 00:13:41.050
Amata!

00:13:47.230 --> 00:13:48.300
What the...?

00:13:49.880 --> 00:13:51.450
The Wings of the Sun!

00:13:57.940 --> 00:14:01.440
I won't let you beat me!

00:14:06.970 --> 00:14:11.740
I'm so close... I can almost hear the melody I've been searching for...

00:14:14.370 --> 00:14:16.680
Shrade!

00:14:16.680 --> 00:14:19.300
What's wrong, Shrade?!

00:14:19.910 --> 00:14:22.880
Can you hear it, my friend?

00:14:22.880 --> 00:14:25.130
Isn't that sound so beautiful?

00:14:36.670 --> 00:14:37.640
Silvie!

00:14:37.640 --> 00:14:38.760
Mikono!

00:14:44.360 --> 00:14:46.860
Shrade's vital levels are dropping fast!

00:14:47.250 --> 00:14:49.860
Further combat will put his life in danger!

00:14:49.860 --> 00:14:53.910
Element Change! Swap Shrade for Yunoha!

00:14:53.910 --> 00:14:55.210
Wait!

00:14:56.240 --> 00:14:58.520
I can still fight...

00:14:58.520 --> 00:15:00.250
Just a little more...

00:15:00.250 --> 00:15:03.000
I almost...

00:15:03.000 --> 00:15:05.500
Element Charge! Hurry!

00:15:08.510 --> 00:15:11.010
Yunoha Thrul, entering battle!

00:15:19.940 --> 00:15:21.600
Not so fast!

00:15:26.920 --> 00:15:30.950
The Legendary Aquarion's higher-dimensional quantum emissions are off the charts!

00:15:30.950 --> 00:15:35.500
Fudo, what is your goal?

00:15:35.500 --> 00:15:39.450
Wasn't all this written in the Book of Genesis?

00:15:39.450 --> 00:15:43.710
Legends can only be written by great and noble lives.

00:15:43.710 --> 00:15:48.710
Using spilled blood as ink.

00:15:49.870 --> 00:15:51.720
You won't stop them, then?

00:15:51.720 --> 00:15:54.720
There is no difference between moving and stopping.

00:15:57.490 --> 00:16:00.710
When you clap your hands, what remains between them?

00:16:00.710 --> 00:16:04.350
Nothing. Just an empty void, a zero.

00:16:05.810 --> 00:16:09.620
But zero is not always nothing.

00:16:09.620 --> 00:16:14.980
Zero is a value obtained by adding a positive and a negative together.

00:16:16.210 --> 00:16:20.230
That is Mikono Suzushiro's power of connection.

00:16:21.480 --> 00:16:25.660
Dark and light. Holy and profane. Good and evil.

00:16:25.660 --> 00:16:28.500
Positive and negative.

00:16:29.330 --> 00:16:32.010
Let both of their sealed memories be unlocked,

00:16:32.710 --> 00:16:36.760
and the infinite power of zero will be unleashed.

00:16:36.760 --> 00:16:41.540
Now, a new page is turning!

00:17:15.680 --> 00:17:16.950
What?

00:17:23.000 --> 00:17:24.350
I can't take any more!

00:17:31.400 --> 00:17:35.460
Come to my breast, Wings of the Sun!

00:17:42.050 --> 00:17:43.900
He took the Legendary Aquarion!

00:17:48.330 --> 00:17:49.830
Amata!

00:17:50.460 --> 00:17:53.450
The Gate's open. Let's go.

00:18:08.230 --> 00:18:13.440
Both Abductors and the Legendary Aquarion have entered the Dimension Gate!

00:18:16.760 --> 00:18:19.960
Please, Chairman Crea.

00:18:19.960 --> 00:18:23.700
Once more... Let me go once more...

00:18:25.760 --> 00:18:28.960
You will die this time.

00:18:33.290 --> 00:18:38.220
You must've known, ever since you brought me to Neo-Deava,

00:18:39.270 --> 00:18:41.470
that it would end this way someday.

00:19:01.330 --> 00:19:03.270
Just promise me one thing.

00:19:03.980 --> 00:19:08.250
When you complete your song, let me hear it.

00:19:17.160 --> 00:19:18.750
Mikono!

00:19:21.510 --> 00:19:23.010
Shrade!

00:19:25.510 --> 00:19:27.970
Both Vectors have entered the Dimension Gate!

00:19:27.970 --> 00:19:29.350
We've lost contact!

00:19:36.080 --> 00:19:37.750
Where are Mikono and Kagura?

00:19:37.750 --> 00:19:38.780
Amata!

00:19:44.450 --> 00:19:47.090
To complete the final song...

00:19:47.780 --> 00:19:50.900
I have to take back the Legendary Aquarion first!

00:19:50.900 --> 00:19:52.640
But we can't take him on alone!

00:19:52.640 --> 00:19:54.460
I'll Union with you!

00:19:54.460 --> 00:19:56.670
Zessica! You're alive!

00:19:57.930 --> 00:20:01.580
Amata, this is how I can show my love for you.

00:20:02.210 --> 00:20:06.260
Destiny Union! Go, Aquarion!

00:20:15.450 --> 00:20:16.480
Amata!

00:20:16.900 --> 00:20:19.110
Thank you, Zessica.

00:20:20.360 --> 00:20:22.360
My very soul is vibrating!

00:20:27.530 --> 00:20:29.870
Aquarion Spada!

00:20:33.560 --> 00:20:34.960
The Legendary Aquarion!

00:20:39.530 --> 00:20:40.550
Got you.

00:20:45.330 --> 00:20:46.180
Wow!

00:20:47.290 --> 00:20:50.180
Now repent your sins...

00:20:50.900 --> 00:20:52.680
Crucifixion Sword!

00:21:12.000 --> 00:21:13.000
Shrade!

00:21:19.290 --> 00:21:20.380
The Dimension Gate is opening!

00:21:20.910 --> 00:21:23.720
Mithra Gnis is coming out on this side!

00:21:23.720 --> 00:21:25.880
We're detecting a Rare Igura in the cockpit!

00:21:26.330 --> 00:21:29.470
The Rare Igura that Kagura has been after all this time...

00:21:30.980 --> 00:21:33.650
She could well be the true Eve.

00:21:34.840 --> 00:21:36.270
Prepare all units to sortie!

00:21:37.000 --> 00:21:41.210
We cannot let Kagura take our true Eve for himself!

00:21:47.530 --> 00:21:51.540
We have reports of crustal movement and abnormal weather all over the world!

00:21:51.540 --> 00:21:55.540
The seal on the Legendary Aquarion has been lifted.

00:21:55.980 --> 00:22:00.670
The balance between Vega and Altair it sustained is now shifting.

00:22:00.670 --> 00:22:06.120
We lost the Legendary Aquarion, and we can't contact the Elements...

00:22:07.490 --> 00:22:09.680
We're helpless here!

00:22:09.680 --> 00:22:12.680
What is going to happen to the world?

00:22:12.680 --> 00:22:14.680
There is still hope.

00:22:15.470 --> 00:22:21.630
The Wings of the Sun will not move in the absence of its chosen Element.

00:22:25.640 --> 00:22:27.950
It's time.

00:22:31.050 --> 00:22:37.250
Time to fulfill your promise, girl with hair the color of grass.

00:24:10.800 --> 00:24:13.590
Let me tell you what I like.

00:24:13.590 --> 00:24:15.430
Colorful, scattered flower petals

00:24:15.430 --> 00:24:17.310
and Kagura's screams.

00:24:17.690 --> 00:24:19.810
I'll tell you what I hate, too.

00:24:19.810 --> 00:24:23.350
Lies, betrayal...

00:24:23.350 --> 00:24:25.060
and him.
